<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; height: 100%; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;"><span>Writes the values of the selected recipe to its symbols. <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">ActivateRecipe</code></span></p>
